---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About QuickChartMaker — Free Online Chart Tool"
  description="QuickChartMaker is a free, no-signup chart maker for students, content creators, and small businesses."
>
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-6">About QuickChartMaker</h1>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 space-y-4">
    <p>
      QuickChartMaker is a free online tool that lets anyone create clean, shareable charts in seconds —
      no account required, no watermarks, no software to install.
    </p>
    <p>
      It was built for people who just need a chart: students working on a project, content creators
      making a data post, or small business owners tracking their numbers. Instead of wrestling with
      spreadsheet software, you enter your data, pick a style, and screenshot the result.
    </p>
    <p>
      The chart tool runs locally in your browser, so the data you enter for chart creation is not uploaded to our servers during normal use.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
